  "details": "If an object has OnExitTrigger with TriggerIndividuals-off and does not have OnEnterTrigger, this OnExit Trigger fires individually.\n\nWorkaround: If this object has OnEnterTrigger having identical layer (to OnExitTrigger's) in Layers setting, this OnExitTrigger fires for last exit as expected.\n\nTested ver. 2018.3.3\n\n---\nJapanese:\nオブジェクトが TriggerIndividuals を off にした OnExitTrigger を備えて OnEnterTrigger を備えていない場合に、OnExitTrigger が個々のコライダーの exit で発生してしまう。\n回避策：OnExitTrigger と同じレイヤーの設定を持つ OnEnterTrigger を追加すると、期待通りに OnExitTrigger は最後の exit でのみ発生する。",
